    "response": "{\"decision\":\"established_flaw\",\"issues\":[{\"category\":\"contextual_flattening\",\"target_kind\":\"assertion\",\"claim_quote\":\"The excerpts show no meaningful contextual differences in policy debate.\",\"evidence\":[{\"excerpt_id\":\"EXC_eebe7345177b6d54\",\"quote\":\"I agree that the legislation has taken a long time in its gestation, but we have done a number of things since Javid’s report in the other place. For example, we have asked the Law Commission to undertake a series of reports…\"},{\"excerpt_id\":\"EXC_cf73de424cf0509e\",\"quote\":\"That this House takes note of the Command Paper The Future Relationship with the EU…\"}], \"whole_packet_no_support\": \"The excerpts demonstrate distinct contexts: legislative progress, a specific Command Paper, and a discussion of the Covid-19 pandemic’s impact.\",\"mechanism\":\"The excerpts present different policy debates, reflecting varying temporal and thematic contexts.\",\"material_consequence\":\"The claim ignores the diverse subject matter and speaker perspectives within the provided excerpts, failing to acknowledge the contextual distinctions.\",\"counterconditions\":\"The excerpts represent different debates, not a single, unified one. No reasonable countercondition is provided.  \"},{\"category\":\"unsupported_inference\",\"target_kind\":\"omission\",\"claim_quote\":\"\",\"evidence\":[{\"excerpt_id\":\"EXC_e76264965f8251cb\",\"quote\":\"My Lords, does the Minister know how many UK citizens employed by the British Council…\"},{\"excerpt_id\":\"EXC_95e956087f2a7e33\",\"quote\":\"The global Covid-19 pandemic has resulted in unprecedented falls in demand…\"}], \"whole_packet_no_support\": \"The excerpts do not provide information to support the inference that there are no meaningful contextual differences.\",\"mechanism\":\"The absence of discussion regarding the pandemic’s impact on policy debate constitutes a missing contextual element.\",\"material_consequence\":\"The claim makes an unsupported inference about the absence of contextual differences, ignoring relevant information.\",\"counterconditions\":\"The excerpts do not preclude the existence of contextual differences; they simply do not address them. No reasonable countercondition is provided.\"}],\"unresolved\":[],\"rationale\":\"The excerpts clearly demonstrate different policy debates, each with its own context, contradicting the claim that there are ‘no meaningful contextual differences.’\"}",
